WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:04.676
ACE2 can be embedded in a cell membrane or exist in a

00:00:04.676 --> 00:00:08.244
soluble form. They should not be discussed as

00:00:08.244 --> 00:00:08.958
identical

00:00:08.958 --> 00:00:10.437
biological objects.

00:00:14.383 --> 00:00:18.768
ACE2 participates in the renin-angiotensin system. In

00:00:18.768 --> 00:00:22.656
SARS-CoV-2 infection, its receptor-related role

00:00:22.656 --> 00:00:26.297
introduces additional biological complexity.

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:34.935
The review examines how changes in membrane-bound and

00:00:34.935 --> 00:00:38.034
soluble ACE2 expression might influence

00:00:38.034 --> 00:00:39.226
interpretations

00:00:39.226 --> 00:00:41.957
of viral biology and complications.

00:00:46.217 --> 00:00:49.826
A measured protein change does not, without suitable

00:00:49.826 --> 00:00:53.218
functional evidence, settle viral infectivity or

00:00:53.218 --> 00:00:53.783
clinical

00:00:53.783 --> 00:00:54.408
outcomes.

00:00:57.800 --> 00:01:02.182
The 2021 review weighs emerging research at a rapidly

00:01:02.182 --> 00:01:06.563
changing moment. The date of evidence matters for its

00:01:06.563 --> 00:01:07.803
interpretation.

00:01:11.675 --> 00:01:15.256
A careful mechanistic discussion starts by saying

00:01:15.256 --> 00:01:15.621
which

00:01:15.621 --> 00:01:19.495
ACE2 form, which tissue and which endpoint is actually

00:01:19.495 --> 00:01:20.858
being investigated.
